    "dialogue": [
      {
        "character_id": "character_eac118bceb9733dc90a1",
        "end_ms": 11600,
        "line_id": "dialogue_65ea96ce3201083ff96f",
        "ordinal": 0,
        "scene_id": "scene_3c1c4be2125f4ae91624",
        "schema_version": "1.0.0",
        "start_ms": 6800,
        "text": "辞职信在桌上。天亮前，我就走。"
      },
      {
        "character_id": "character_43019e6eefc52eee8f6b",
        "end_ms": 15600,
        "line_id": "dialogue_2086b57f33fe54845c7e",
        "ordinal": 1,
        "scene_id": "scene_3c1c4be2125f4ae91624",
        "schema_version": "1.0.0",
        "start_ms": 14000,
        "text": "我不同意。"
      },
      {
        "character_id": "character_eac118bceb9733dc90a1",
        "end_ms": 24800,
        "line_id": "dialogue_72f37bc5d434536ce911",
        "ordinal": 2,
        "scene_id": "scene_3c1c4be2125f4ae91624",
        "schema_version": "1.0.0",
        "start_ms": 20900,
        "text": "项目都停了，你拿什么留我？"
      },
      {
        "character_id": "character_43019e6eefc52eee8f6b",
        "end_ms": 32600,
        "line_id": "dialogue_685d8e8ddc4ef11e0a62",
        "ordinal": 3,
        "scene_id": "scene_3c1c4be2125f4ae91624",
        "schema_version": "1.0.0",
        "start_ms": 28900,
        "text": "不是留你。跟我上天台。"
      },
      {
        "character_id": "character_43019e6eefc52eee8f6b",
        "end_ms": 41800,
        "line_id": "dialogue_bf8392058acb05cdc2c1",
        "ordinal": 4,
        "scene_id": "scene_58fe397959f557215593",
        "schema_version": "1.0.0",
        "start_ms": 36900,
        "text": "三个月前，我把你的方案投进了城南改造终审。"
      },
      {
        "character_id": "character_eac118bceb9733dc90a1",
        "end_ms": 46100,
        "line_id": "dialogue_23efbffb1c41cdb8e720",
        "ordinal": 5,
        "scene_id": "scene_58fe397959f557215593",
        "schema_version": "1.0.0",
        "start_ms": 44100,
        "text": "你没问过我。"
      },
      {
        "character_id": "character_43019e6eefc52eee8f6b",
        "end_ms": 55600,
        "line_id": "dialogue_7cccb7d8b6edaa29d71a",
        "ordinal": 6,
        "scene_id": "scene_58fe397959f557215593",
        "schema_version": "1.0.0",
        "start_ms": 50900,
        "text": "所以今天不是替你决定，是请你自己选。"
      },
      {
        "character_id": "character_43019e6eefc52eee8f6b",
        "end_ms": 62200,
        "line_id": "dialogue_394d96060d7f03763924",
        "ordinal": 7,
        "scene_id": "scene_58fe397959f557215593",
        "schema_version": "1.0.0",
        "start_ms": 58900,
        "text": "合伙人，或者自由建筑师。"
      },
      {
        "character_id": "character_eac118bceb9733dc90a1",
        "end_ms": 70400,
        "line_id": "dialogue_8d2d6305b45e90b93509",
        "ordinal": 8,
        "scene_id": "scene_58fe397959f557215593",
        "schema_version": "1.0.0",
        "start_ms": 65700,
        "text": "辞职信照旧。明天，我会以合伙人的身份回来。"
      }
    ],
